urator of Oral History to manage all aspects of History Colorado’s oral history collections. In October of 2018, an initial survey of the 700 + recordings identified as oral histories began. The goal of the project includes adding the material to the Argus database and increasing its exposure and access.","tags":["#idaho"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},